    "q-3292": {
      "dom_id": "step-q3292",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "What is the average value of $g(x)=\\sqrt[3]{x}$ on the interval $[1,8]?$",
      "worked_solution": "Applying the average value formula, we find that the average value of the function is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{1}{b-a}\\,{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8-1}{\\int }_{1}^{8}\\sqrt[3]{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{1}{7}(\\frac{3}{4}{x}^{4/3})|}_{1}^{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}[(\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot {8}^{4/3})-(\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot {1}^{4/3})] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}[(\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot ({8}^{1/3})^{4})-\\frac{3}{4}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}[(\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot {2}^{4})-\\frac{3}{4}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}[(\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 16)-\\frac{3}{4}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}(12-\\frac{3}{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{45}{28}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
